      "writtenOn": "2024-04-26T20:25:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Per UCSI, LPM manages a single USB type-c connector, so it doesn\u0027t make sense to have multiple PDCs associated with an LPM driver.\n\nAs I think about this more, you\u0027ve really implemented a PPM driver here, and the `pdc` property is really the list of LPMs supported by the PPM.\n\nSo this should be \"ucsi,ppm-driver\", and the property would be \"lpm\".",
